What:		/sys/bus/platform/devices/.../charger_status
What:		/sys/bus/platform/devices/.../battery_status
What:		/sys/bus/platform/devices/.../temperature_status
What:		/sys/bus/platform/devices/.../batif_realtime_status
Date:		October 2026
Description:
		Read-only raw PM8150B SMB5 status bytes in hexadecimal. These
		attributes correspond to register offsets 0x006, 0x007, 0x00d,
		and 0x210 relative to the charger base, respectively. A read
		failure is returned to userspace; zero is not substituted.
		Values describe individual instants, not an atomic fault history
		or proof that protection is enabled or functioning.

What:		/sys/bus/platform/devices/.../usb_suspend_command
Date:		October 2026
Description:
		Read-only raw USB input command byte at offset 0x340 relative to
		the charger base. Bit 0 is the USB input suspend command. Reading
		the command alone does not prove that the power path has stopped.

What:		/sys/bus/platform/devices/.../fcc_config
What:		/sys/bus/platform/devices/.../fv_config
What:		/sys/bus/platform/devices/.../usb_icl_config
What:		/sys/bus/platform/devices/.../jeita_config
What:		/sys/bus/platform/devices/.../watchdog_config
What:		/sys/bus/platform/devices/.../watchdog_timeout_config
What:		/sys/bus/platform/devices/.../thermal_source_config
Date:		October 2026
Description:
		Read-only raw configuration bytes in hexadecimal. Register offsets
		are 0x061, 0x070, 0x370, 0x090, 0x651, 0x653 and 0x670 relative
		to the charger base. A read failure returns an error. A configuration
		value does not prove a protection action has been verified.

What:		/sys/bus/platform/devices/.../safety_timer_enable_config
What:		/sys/bus/platform/devices/.../safety_timer_duration_config
Date:		October 2026
Description:
		Read-only raw safety timer configuration bytes in hexadecimal,
		at offsets 0x0a0 and 0x0a2 relative to the charger base. The
		first byte includes the precharge and fast-charge enable bits;
		the second encodes fast-charge duration. Their values do not
		prove that timer expiry actually stops charging.

