What:		/sys/bus/platform/devices/.../recharge_voltage_msb
What:		/sys/bus/platform/devices/.../recharge_voltage_lsb
What:		/sys/bus/platform/devices/.../term_source_config
Date:		October 2026
Description:
		Raw hexadecimal termination and recharge configuration bytes at
		offsets 0x051, 0x067 through 0x06c, 0x07d through 0x07f, and
		0x0c0 relative to the charger base. Separate reads are not atomic;
		the raw bytes do not prove that termination or recharge works.
